From ab5a4e388a988ef00917ff97fe8019bfb8d6c5b7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: draconic-fix <draconic-fix@localhost>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 12:27:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Draconic: player housing commands, solo dungeons, hero spell
 costs

- .house buy [plot] | info | abandon: buy the plot next to the cornerstone (7 yd) or by index; the first house is free; no unsolicited client replies
- Failure reasons of HandleNeighborhoodBuyHouse are logged
- Solo dungeons (draconic_solo_dungeon): lone hero in a 5-man dungeon fights creatures with reduced health and carries boon auras; Earthen Wall Totem script; leave the LFG group of one outside the dungeon; drop orphaned permanent debuffs
- Hero spell costs: world.hero_spell_cost makes pool spells cost Essence (SpellInfo::CalcPowerCost), loaded in SpellMgr::LoadHeroSpellCosts

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
